name 'iterating-with-ai-preassessment-q1_2025'

question 'In programming, what is the primary purpose of "iteration"?'

wrong 'To create a single variable that stores multiple values.wer'
right 'To repeat a block of code multiple times until a specific condition is met.'
wrong 'To permanently delete data that the user no longer needs.'
wrong 'To change the color and layout of a web application.'

allow_multiple_attempts false

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lesson 1

Iteration (loops) allows developers to automate repetitive tasks, like processing every item in a list or repeating an action until a "stopping condition" is reached.
MARKDOWN
